{"3567980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stan's Workshop", "steam_appid": 3567980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox chaos, backyard inventions, and revenge on Baldy - time to take action!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stan's garage has been taken over by Baldy's dirty tricks. Now, as Rafa, it's up to you to help your buddy take back what's rightfully his! But remember - a plan? Well... let's just say pure improvisation, absurdity, and total mayhem rule here.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker, sabotage, and build your own backyard inventions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify cars, test ridiculous ideas, and hustle your way to the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break stuff, mess around, and create chaos wherever and however you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry out the wildest revenge plan ever seen - but beware: every action can have unpredictable consequences!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stan's Workshop </strong>is a sandbox adventure full of humor, freedom, and absurd situations where every player writes their own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist and get ready for the craziest garage showdown ever!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox chaos, backyard inventions, and revenge on Baldy - time to take action!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stan's garage has been taken over by Baldy's dirty tricks. Now, as Rafa, it's up to you to help your buddy take back what's rightfully his! But remember - a plan? Well... let's just say pure improvisation, absurdity, and total mayhem rule here.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker, sabotage, and build your own backyard inventions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify cars, test ridiculous ideas, and hustle your way to the top.</